  Background:
    Given IClock.Now 回傳 "2026-05-08T09:00:00+08:00"
    And 檔案 "${TEST_DATA_ROOT}/TenderSearch/data/2026-05/2026-05-08/tenders.json" 存在，Items 共 55 筆
    And DailyQueryViewModel 已載入 Date = 2026-05-08
